      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "60 feet. DC 45 Fortitude save\n\nA creature entering or starting its turn in the aura that fails at a Fortitude save becomes Doomed 1 and Drained 1. If the target was already doomed or drained, the values of these conditions increase by 1, to a maximum of doomed 3 and drained 3. A creature that dies while doomed 3 and drained 3 in this way disintegrates into black sand.",
