    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Unkillable",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Unlike most undead, Iffdahsil isn't destroyed at 0 HP. Iffdahsil's fast healing continues to function normally, though on any round it begins its turn at 0 HP, it is Enfeebled 4 and Slowed 1 until the start of its next turn. While Iffdahsil is at 0 HP, it can be killed permanently only by simultaneously exposing it to direct sunlight (or a 10th-rank Sunburst spell) and casting a Miracle or Wish spell (or similar magic) directed at destroying it."
    },
