      "name": "Tentacular Burst",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Iffdahsil deals 8d8 piercing damage to each creature in a 10-foot emanation (DC 43 basic Reflex save save) and can also attempt to Grab any creatures who critically fail their save as a free action. Iffdahsil is then Off-Guard until the start of its next turn."
